# Partner Discovery UI

Discovery is for finding language-learning partners.

## Partner cards

Useful information may include:
- display name
- profile photo
- languages spoken
- languages learning
- proficiency
- learning goals
- interests
- availability
- short introduction

Do not show:
- attractiveness scores
- dating compatibility
- romantic labels
- unnecessary private information

## Filters

Useful filters:
- language
- proficiency
- learning goal
- interests
- availability/timezone where appropriate

Keep filters understandable.

## Interaction

Do not default to Tinder-style swipe mechanics.

Prefer:
- browse
- filter
- open profile
- connect/practice
- save/bookmark if the product has it

If the product intentionally includes swiping for discovery, it must still represent learning compatibility and not romantic selection.

## Empty states

Explain why there may be no results and offer useful actions:
- broaden filters
- add another learning language
- complete profile
- try again later
